0..39 Comment "// A `become` inside a handled subject."
40..42 Comment "//"
43..116 Comment "// A handled scope holds its handler until its subject returns, so a tail"
117..141 Comment "// call never leaves it."
142..144 Comment "//"
145..217 Comment "// `became` leaves the scope its handler holds by a tail call, which the"
218..238 Comment "// lowering refuses."
239..241 Comment "//"
242..297 Comment "// - see: corpus/ledger/diagnostics/AcrossHandler.gandr"
299..330 Comment "// Early exit\'s host interface."
